OL,3,ABritish man missing after diving into
OL,4,ALake Como to rescue teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian authorities are searching for a
OL,7,FBritish man who has gone missing after
OL,8,Freportedly diving into Lake Como to
OL,9,Frescue a teenager.
OL,11,FThe man was attempting to rescue two
OL,12,Fpeople - a father and son - who were in
OL,13,Fdistress in the water near the San Siro
OL,14,Fmunicipality on the lake's western
OL,15,Fshore on Monday afternoon, Italian
OL,16,Fmedia report.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
