OL,3,ABritish man missing after diving into
OL,4,ALake Como to rescue teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man and the family he was friends
OL,7,Fwith had reportedly been on a boating
OL,8,Ftrip at the time. The father and son
OL,9,Fwere later rescued by another passing
OL,10,Fboat, but the man has not been seen
OL,11,Fagain.
OL,13,FThe UK Foreign Office said: "We are
OL,14,Fsupporting the family of a British
OL,15,Fnational missing in Italy and are in
OL,16,Fcontact with the local authorities."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
